flowchart TD
    A[Client submits connection request] --> B[Customer manager validates client data]
    B --> C[System checks requested service]
    C --> D{Enough network capacity?}
    D -- Yes --> E[Request approved]
    D -- No --> F[Capacity check required]
    E --> G[Agreement is created]
    G --> H[Equipment and services are attached]
    H --> I[Technical ticket is created]
    I --> J[Support specialist completes installation]
    J --> K[Payment operation is registered]
